1
00:00:00,154 --> 00:00:02,744
(Raj:)I'm the friend you call
when you have no other options.

2
00:00:02,906 --> 00:00:06,366
(Raj:)If we were the Justice League,
I'd be Aquaman.

3
00:00:07,328 --> 00:00:08,578
(Howard:)I wish you were Aquaman.

4
00:00:08,787 --> 00:00:11,827
(Howard:)Then I could send you to scoop my mom
out of the old-lady tank.

5
00:00:13,834 --> 00:00:15,874
(Sheldon:)Excuse me, I'm thirsty...

6
00:00:16,045 --> 00:00:20,885
(Sheldon:)...so I'm going to go to the refrigerator
and get myself a refreshing beverage.

7
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:25,390
(Leonard:)You know what?
I'll just spend the evening alone.

8
00:00:25,554 --> 00:00:28,344
What? Suddenly, I'm not good enough
for you?

9
00:00:34,938 --> 00:00:36,938
[SIGHS]

10
00:00:37,816 --> 00:00:39,566
(Sheldon:)I do so love beverages.

11
00:00:40,861 --> 00:00:44,451
(Sheldon:)Now I think
I'll take my after-dinner walk.

12
00:00:46,867 --> 00:00:49,247
(Leonard:)Since when do you take
after-dinner walks?

13
00:00:49,411 --> 00:00:51,371
(Howard:)Since when do you take walks?

14
00:00:52,122 --> 00:00:56,422
(Sheldon:)I read a study online that walking
after a meal not only aids in digestion...

15
00:00:56,585 --> 00:00:57,965
(Sheldon:)...but increases serotonin.

16
00:00:58,128 --> 00:01:03,018
(Sheldon:)If there's one thing I like more than a
refreshing beverage, it's serotonin. Bye.

